-The administration portal uses Next.js 16.1.3 with the App Router, combining React Server Components with client-side interactive tables powered by TanStack React Table and forms validated through React Hook Form and Zod schemas. The user interface uses Tailwind CSS with shadcn/Radix UI components, while charting and time-series analytics use Recharts and date-fns, with Lucide React icons. Server-side Supabase SSR clients handle administrative authentication; privileged adapters support protected data operations. Sonner provides toast notifications and next-themes supports light and dark UI themes.
